+ * \param[in] maximum Maximum value representable in that scale
+ *
+ * Apply the gain to the signed black-subtracted signal, then restore the
+ * pedestal and clamp to the sample range. Retaining the pedestal allows AWB
+ * and AGC to keep their existing black-level subtraction.
